#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:5 f05f2b2685e64da9ba337883a4b7ffde
msgid "Swarm"
msgstr "集群"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:11 e50a3f629e374bbe8959b9e3cc6b1a41
msgid ""
"This module is a GUI for managing swarms of vehicles (typically 2-10 "
"vehicles)."
msgstr "此模块是用于管理无人机集群（通常为2至10架飞行器）的图形界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:13 b035e0f2ed0a4ce884c65a90493eb289
msgid ""
"It allows individual or group-based simultaneous control of swarm members."
msgstr "它支持对集群成员进行单独或基于编组的同步控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:15 95360f24ead4452392e8c7a464a3c708
msgid ""
"The swarm parameters (:ref:`MAV_SYSID<MAV_SYSID>` and "
":ref:`FOLL_SYSID<FOLL_SYSID>`) should be configured beforehand."
msgstr ""
"应事先配置集群参数（:ref:`MAV_SYSID<MAV_SYSID>` 和 :ref:`FOLL_SYSID<FOLL_SYSID>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:17 59898d9ed18a4eb49a4e9cade4162d96
msgid ""
"The GUI will show each swarm as a single row, with the swarm leader being "
"the leftmost vehicle."
msgstr "图形界面将每个集群显示为一行，集群领队位于最左侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:19 5cb525536ec54b53b46299c52dbcfe2d
msgid ""
"Any vehicles not in a swarm will be shown in the \"Unassigned vehicles\" row"
" at the bottom."
msgstr "未加入任何集群的飞行器将显示在底部的「未分配飞行器」行中。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:21 eec6df6c87de4bef85827f829ec4dd62
msgid "The GUI itself allows:"
msgstr "图形界面本身支持以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:23 e8cd616f5d714c35bc685878d01d92f3
msgid "Mode changes (single and swarm-based)"
msgstr "模式切换（单机及集群模式）"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:24 a21682e2cd354543aabb0a7dd35e9906
msgid "High level information about each vehicle shown"
msgstr "显示每架飞行器的高层信息"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:25 66646edd2e2245d8a1cf77423e27155f
msgid "Arm and disarming"
msgstr "加锁与解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/swarm.rst:26 aee9adbfdff940049730010046b13100
msgid "Kill-switch to immediately disarm"
msgstr "急停开关，用于立即解锁"
